From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: hjviewer <haejin.cho@yonsei.ac.kr>
Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 18:45:01 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 06/61] hjviewer: App Store upload requirements for iOS

- Runner/PrivacyInfo.xcprivacy: the Rust core calls stat/fstat/lstat
  (file timestamps, reason C617.1: files in the app container); the
  device ID registered with the hjviewer server is collected for app
  functionality; no tracking. Added to the Runner target's resources.
- Plugins on Apple's privacy-impacting SDK list move to the first
  releases that ship a privacy manifest and still support Flutter
  3.24.5: sqflite 2.3.3+1, file_picker 8.0.7, package_info_plus 8.0.2,
  device_info_plus 10.1.2 (wakelock_plus follows to 1.3.3).
- Podfile: file_picker without its photo and music pickers, so the
  DKImagePickerController/DKPhotoGallery/SDWebImage/SwiftyGif pods and
  the MediaPlayer use leave the app; pods target iOS 13 like the app.
  The Runner target's own OTHER_LDFLAGS list stops naming those four.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 flutter/ios/Podfile                          |  7 +++-
 flutter/ios/Runner.xcodeproj/project.pbxproj | 28 +++------------
 flutter/ios/Runner/PrivacyInfo.xcprivacy     | 36 ++++++++++++++++++++
 flutter/pubspec.lock                         | 24 ++++++-------
 flutter/pubspec.yaml                         |  8 ++---
 5 files changed, 62 insertions(+), 41 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 flutter/ios/Runner/PrivacyInfo.xcprivacy

diff --git a/flutter/ios/Podfile b/flutter/ios/Podfile
index b71c436..caafc59 100644
--- a/flutter/ios/Podfile
+++ b/flutter/ios/Podfile
@@ -3,6 +3,11 @@ ENV['COCOAPODS_DISABLE_STATS'] = 'true'
 
 platform :ios, '13.0'
 
+# file_picker is never used on iOS; without its photo and music pickers the app ships no
+# DKImagePickerController, DKPhotoGallery, SDWebImage or SwiftyGif and no MediaPlayer use
+Pod::PICKER_MEDIA = false
+Pod::PICKER_AUDIO = false
+
 project 'Runner', {
   'Debug' => :debug,
   'Profile' => :release,
@@ -37,7 +42,7 @@ post_install do |installer|
   installer.pods_project.targets.each do |target|
     flutter_additional_ios_build_settings(target)
     target.build_configurations.each do |config|
-      config.build_settings['IPHONEOS_DEPLOYMENT_TARGET'] = '11.0'
+      config.build_settings['IPHONEOS_DEPLOYMENT_TARGET'] = '13.0'
     end
   end
 end
